{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STORY<br><br>...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this world, only two clones remain\u00a0 you and your brother.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your brother is consumed by rage. He believes humanity must be punished, that everyone should die for what they\u2019ve done to you both. He destroyed the laboratory, slaughtered everyone inside, and even killed you\u2026 yet left you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now he hunts for control of the New World. If you follow his path, he will kill you again. The only way to survive is to grow stronger than him: level up, find better gear, and unlock new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the land are mysterious Crystals. These fragments hold pieces of your lost memory, guiding you through the story while granting experience and rewards. Collect them, uncover the truth, and prepare for the final fight against your brother.\u00ad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>.Made By a Solo Dev. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Last Pulse Studio </strong><br> We Make Simple and Fun Games </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/164776d53a2263269f9be7ddf10bbe0f.avif?t=1759425106\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/aff6c9aea73424ec5e38731428416f82.avif?t=1759425106\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Uncover Your Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of a secret lab, recover lost files, and piece together the truth along with fragments of your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/0c963d93e3b3b7fc4f3275db7707d99b.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were taken as a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripped from your home and locked away in a hidden laboratory. You were different your parents knew it. The government knew it. And they wanted to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested. Modified. Controlled. You were meant to be a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the experiment failed. Your powers were stolen, replicated, and twisted. Instead of strength, the military\u2019s project unleashed devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/9f81f268daed7a68f277f3f7ccf10dbe.avif?t=1759425106\" width=610 height=88 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Open-World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a vast post-apocalyptic wasteland filled with zombies, hostile survivors, and the remnants of the military that created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/e0f6ef34fc030a5ab68154afb1cd1806.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/2281e0270cdaf3d2b9e3f4b989fc94c1.avif?t=1759425106\" width=610 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatterland</strong> is a survival/exploration open-world zombie game featuring base-building, skill progression, and online co-op play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, fight, and explore a shattered world while reclaiming your past. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Low-Poly World</strong><br>A unique visual style that brings clarity and charm to your survival journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/50a257fdf35324a330043dd92663d2e4.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Fight to Survive</strong><br>Battle hordes of the undead, hostile survivors, and twisted military experiments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/b5344976948c4491e231e2122b40f932.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/b5344976948c4491e231e2122b40f932.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/b5344976948c4491e231e2122b40f932.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Quest System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on story-driven adventures and discover the secrets of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/957bbe0f6f1229c7922b7147218ae8a5.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Vehicle System</strong><br>Repair, upgrade, and maintain vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong> <br>Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Barricade</strong><br>Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Survive Together</strong> <br>Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong> <br>Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.<br><br><br>Last Pulse Studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/1bb016129ff5ad1b6ee5a21119b47384.avif?t=1759425106\" data-has-big width=1560 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721680?t=1759425106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/8afc3da432cdf2555301ee87b2e6957ee8602ee8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759425106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/d737107b4375f054e23a9736bca8340274e0c400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759425106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/d737107b4375f054e23a9736bca8340274e0c400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759425106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_des