o/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Vehicle System</strong><br>Repair, upgrade, and maintain vehicles to traverse the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/f205b10690c5e95267e3d27af874e12f.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong> <br>Level up by surviving. Unlock new abilities and reclaim fragments of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.poster.avif?t=1759425106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.webm?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/5a4c5c881736cf9c2402a07137487ab4.mp4?t=1759425106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Barricade</strong><br>Create safe zones anywhere. Fortify your shelter and hold out against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Adapt to changing conditions where every hour brings new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Survive Together</strong> <br>Play solo or in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face greater threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, adjust difficulty, and tailor the experience to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong> <br>Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and survival gear to improve your chances.<br><br><br>Last Pulse Studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/1bb016129ff5ad1b6ee5a21119b47384.avif?t=1759425106\" data-has-big width=1560 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LastPulse Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/a79a75e73536aff140fc93608fd4de198f8b4291/header.jpg?t=1759425106","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All right reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3721680/81462257/bacb9f81afc4f3052283dfe2f26d437443f9ba3e/1757368949/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757377310","dash_h264":"http